t one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nWu Xuan and Peng Cheng are both landscape photography enthusiasts, preparing to go on a road trip together, but they have a dispute over the choice of travel destination. Ya Nan is their friend and also a travel agency staff. When the argument starts to heat up, Wu Xuan glances at Ya Nan, she is reading a travel guide about snow mountains. After a little consideration, Wu Xuan shifts the topic to the photography equipment needed for the trip, involving professional skills of snow mountain environment photography. At this time, he looks at Ya Nan again, throwing her a glance with a smile. Ya Nan responds to his smile knowingly, then picks up the travel guide from the table and walks over. Although Peng Cheng can't see the content of the travel guide, he notices the smiles and eye contact between Wu Xuan and Ya Nan.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Wu Xuan look at Ya Nan when discussing photography skills?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Wu Xuan is expecting Ya Nan to appreciate his rich photography knowledge.\nB. Wu Xuan notices that Ya Nan is reading a travel guide about snow mountains, hinting her to suggest making the snow mountain the travel destination.\nC. Wu Xuan wants to confirm whether Ya Nan listens to his explanation of photography skills.\nD. Wu Xuan wants to hear Ya Nan's opinion on photography skills.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e089d6006945d27fc47e","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367625569,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:27:05","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"417fa18c60d844148beb8776501f8e48"}